    "body": "I think this is ready for re-review.\r\n\r\nPotential issue: XML's definition of [Char](https://www.w3.org/TR/xml/#NT-Char) seems nonsensical (it excludes various Unicode characters below U+0020). And, its definition of the `[^#x00#x09#x0A#0x0Cx0D#x20/>]` syntax depends on that definition. Hmm.",
