    "created_at": "2022-06-07T16:31:14Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-06-07T16:31:14Z",
    "body": "> In particular if the first code point is from BeyondHTMLParserName the second code point was more limited.\r\n\r\nI'm not sure exactly what you mean. Recall that it's a union of both. The second+ code point is from HTMLParserCompatibleName, which had `[^#x00#x09#x0A#0x0Cx0D#x20/>]*` for that position. Which is exactly what the current draft says, right?",
